  credits: "# TWINKLE OPS \u2014 Asset credits and modifications\n\nAll listed resources are stored locally. This game contains no resources extracted from other commercial games.\n\n* M4A1 \u2014 3DModelsCC0, submitted by nisu. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/m4a1-assault-rifle . URP material conversion and original charging-handle animation.\n* AKM \u2014 LonesomeDucky. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/akm . Blender-to-FBX conversion and URP materials.\n* Unfinished Buildings \u2014 loafbrr_1. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/unfinished-buildings . Selected structures arranged into a quarantine construction district; collision-only meshes hidden.\n* Infected worker model \u2014 Pixelhouse. CC BY 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/ . https://opengameart.org/content/zombie . Author website: http://www.pixelhouse.com.ar . Changes: scale, URP materials, humanoid retargeting.\n* Infected animations \u2014 Rikindle3D. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/male-city-zombie-ready-for-use-in-game-engines . Humanoid retargeting and animation state machine. The original burned character mesh is not used in the raid.\n* First-person arms \u2014 para / MakeHuman team. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/fps-arms-rigged-only . URP materials and original procedural poses.\n* Concrete Road Barrier \u2014 Amal Kumar; Barrel 03 \u2014 Serhii Khromov; Old Military Crate \u2014 Jack Mava; Asphalt 02 \u2014 Rob Tuytel. Poly Haven, CC0. https://polyhaven.com/license . Individual sources: https://polyhaven.com/a/concrete_road_barrier , https://polyhaven.com/a/barrel_03 , https://polyhaven.com/a/old_military_crate , https://polyhaven.com/a/asphalt_02 . Changes: 2K texture selection, URP conversion, crate variant selection.\n* Recorded AR-15 and AK-47 shots \u2014 Ben Jaszczak, Brian Nelson, Kevin Heras, Matthew Nanney. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/the-free-firearm-sound-library . Trimmed first shot, mono 48kHz, normalized. AR-15 recording accompanies the M4A1 model.\n* Rifle reload \u2014 SpringySpringo. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/gun-reload-sounds . Recorded using airsoft equipment.\n* Wind loop \u2014 SketchMan3, derived from JaggedStone's Loopable Dungeon Ambience. CC0. https://opengameart.org/content/wind-whoosh-loop and https://opengameart.org/content/loopable-dungeon-ambience .\n* Noto Sans SC \u2014 Google / Noto contributors. SIL Open Font License 1.1; accompanying OFL.txt.\n* Item UI illustrations \u2014 original project artwork created for TWINKLE OPS.\n\nDownload source pages, SHA-256 hashes and original archives are retained under SourceAssets/OpenGameArt and SourceAssets/PolyHaven on the local drive. Only redistributable converted assets are intended for Git LFS.\n"
